==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|es}} {{term|somniāre|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|somniō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/soˈɲaɾ/|lang=es}}

===Verb===
{{es-verb|soñ|ar|pres=sueño}}

# to [[dream]] (of/about)
#: [[soñé|Soñé]] [[contigo]] [[anoche]].
#:: I dreamt about you last night.
#: [[sueño|Sueño]] con [[trabajar|Trabajar]] en esta [[empresa|Empresa]]
#:: I dream of working in this company

====Use of prepositions====
{{rfc-header|Use of prepositions|lang=es}}
* In general terms, 'Dream about' is 'soñar en' y 'Dream of' is 'soñar con'.

====Conjugation====
{{es-conj-ar (o-ue)|s|ñ}}

====Related terms====
* [[sueño]] {{g|m}}
* [[soñador]]

